 "library": {
  "title": "SWAT soldier 1.8 m",
  "description": "A tactical officer (Quaternius CC0 low-poly character, rest pose) kitted out with modelled gear: a plate carrier (front and back plates, cummerbund, shoulder straps, MOLLE webbing rows), three magazine pouches with flaps and pull tabs, an admin pouch, a radio with antenna and status light on the left chest, a grenade on the right chest, a duty belt with buckle, belt pouches and a holstered pistol, knee and elbow pads, a hydration pack on the back, shoulder patches, and a helmet with night-vision mount, side rails and headset ear cups. 1800 mm tall, standing on z = 0, facing -Y. The body is coloured imported meshes (meshes/soldier/); the gear is ordinary KherveCAD nodes (hulls, cubes, cylinders), each named and coloured, so it can be edited or moved. Exported to the KherveOS games with tools/kcad_to_game_glb.py, which re-attaches everything to the original animated skeleton.",
  "tags": [
   "soldier",
